<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Moses was a person who was called by God,</l><l>He was meant to turn the age;</l><l>He was God’s companion, he was for God’s move,</l><l>He was faithful, meek, and sage.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Samuel ministered to be a God-pleasing priest,</l><l>He was absolute for Him;</l><l>Samuel gave himself to be a Nazarite,</l><l>Saved from death, the world, and sin.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
